$\begin{aligned}\underset{\sim}{v}_{AB}&=(4\underset{\sim}{i}+3\underset{\sim}{j})-(9\underset{\sim}{i}+15\underset{\sim}{j})\\&=-5\underset{\sim}{i}-12\underset{\sim}{j}\text{ km/h}\end{aligned}$

The relative velocity points south-west. Let $\theta$ be the angle west of south.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=2mm,y=2mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},draw=black]
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\coordinate (S) at (0,-12);
\coordinate (R) at (-5,-12);
\draw[dashed,->] (O) -- (0,5) node[above] {$N$};
\draw[dashed] (O) -- (S) node[midway,right] {$12$};
\draw[dashed] (S) -- (R) node[midway,below] {$5$};
\draw[->,thick] (O) -- (R) node[midway,left] {$\underset{\sim}{v}_{AB}$};
\draw (0,-4) arc[start angle=270,end angle=247.38,radius=4];
\path (-1.2,-5.5) node {$\theta$};
\path (O) node[above left] {$O$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

$\begin{aligned}\tan\theta&=\frac{5}{12}\\\theta&\approx22.62^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

$\begin{aligned}\text{Bearing}&=180^{\circ}+\tan^{-1}\left(\frac{5}{12}\right)\\&\approx203^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

$\begin{aligned}\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{bank}}&=\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{water}}+\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{current}}\\&=12\underset{\sim}{j}+5\underset{\sim}{i}\\&=5\underset{\sim}{i}+12\underset{\sim}{j}\text{ km/h}\end{aligned}$

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=2mm,y=2mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},draw=black]
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\coordinate (A) at (0,12);
\coordinate (B) at (5,12);
\draw[->,thick] (O) -- (A) node[midway,left] {$12$};
\draw[->,thick] (A) -- (B) node[midway,above] {$5$};
\draw[->,thick] (O) -- (B) node[midway,right] {$13$};
\draw[dashed,->] (A) -- (0,16) node[above] {$N$};
\draw (0,4) arc[start angle=90,end angle=67.38,radius=4];
\path (1.2,5.5) node {$\theta$};
\path (O) node[below] {$O$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

$\begin{aligned}\text{Speed}&=\sqrt{5^2+12^2}\\&=13\text{ km/h}\end{aligned}$

The ground velocity points north-east. Its angle east of north is its bearing.

$\begin{aligned}\tan\theta&=\frac{5}{12}\\\theta&\approx22.62^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

The bearing is $023^{\circ}$ to the nearest degree.

$\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{ground}}=\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{air}}+\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{wind}}$.

$\begin{aligned}\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{air}}&=\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{ground}}-\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{wind}}\\&=\begin{pmatrix}0\\280\end{pmatrix}-\begin{pmatrix}30\\-40\end{pmatrix}\\&=\begin{pmatrix}-30\\320\end{pmatrix}\text{ km/h}\end{aligned}$

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},draw=black]
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\coordinate (A) at (-0.6,6.4);
\coordinate (G) at (0,5.6);
\draw[->,thick] (O) -- (A) node[midway,left] {$\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{air}}$};
\draw[->,thick] (A) -- (G) node[midway,right] {$\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{wind}}$};
\draw[->,thick] (O) -- (G) node[midway,right] {$\underset{\sim}{v}_{\text{ground}}$};
\draw[dashed,->] (G) -- (0,7) node[above] {$N$};
\path (O) node[below] {$O$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Take $\underset{\sim}{i}$ east and $\underset{\sim}{j}$ north. Let the still-water velocity be $a\underset{\sim}{i}+b\underset{\sim}{j}$ km/h.

The bank velocity is $(a+5)\underset{\sim}{i}+b\underset{\sim}{j}$. For travel due north, its east component is zero and $b>0$.

$\begin{aligned}a+5&=0\\a&=-5\end{aligned}$

$\begin{aligned}(-5)^2+b^2&=13^2\\b^2&=144\\b&=12\end{aligned}$

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=2mm,y=2mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},draw=black]
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\coordinate (A) at (-5,12);
\coordinate (G) at (0,12);
\draw[->,thick] (O) -- (A) node[midway,left] {$13$};
\draw[->,thick] (A) -- (G) node[midway,above] {$5$};
\draw[->,thick] (O) -- (G) node[midway,right] {$12$};
\draw[dashed,->] (G) -- (0,16) node[above] {$N$};
\draw (0,4) arc[start angle=90,end angle=112.62,radius=4];
\path (-1.2,5.5) node {$\theta$};
\path (O) node[below] {$O$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The boat steers west of north.

$\begin{aligned}\tan\theta&=\frac{5}{12}\\\theta&\approx22.62^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

$\begin{aligned}\text{Bearing}&=360^{\circ}-\tan^{-1}\left(\frac{5}{12}\right)\\&\approx337^{\circ}\end{aligned}$

The bank velocity is $12\underset{\sim}{j}$ km/h, so the resulting speed is $12$ km/h.
